{% comment %}
  ZAVELYN HAIR CARE — 4-Step Hair Ritual / How It Works
{% endcomment %}
<section class="zvhc-ritual-section" id="how-it-works">
  <div class="zvhc-container">
    <div class="zvhc-section-header">
      <div class="zvhc-eyebrow">SIMPLE 4-STEP ROUTINE</div>
      <h2 class="zvhc-heading-md">How To Practice The Batana Scalp Ritual</h2>
      <p style="color: var(--zvhc-muted); margin-top: 10px; font-size: 0.95rem;">
        Harness the ancient Mesoamerican beauty ritual practiced for centuries by the Tawira ("people of beautiful hair").
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="zvhc-ritual-grid">
      <!-- Step 1 -->
      <div class="zvhc-step-card">
        <div class="zvhc-step-num">01</div>
        <div class="zvhc-step-title">Warm &amp; Activate</div>
        <div class="zvhc-step-desc">
          Dispense 4–6 drops into clean dry palms. Rub hands together vigorously for 5 seconds to melt and activate the dense botanical lipids.
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 2 -->
      <div class="zvhc-step-card">
        <div class="zvhc-step-num">02</div>
        <div class="zvhc-step-title">Scalp Massage</div>
        <div class="zvhc-step-desc">
          Part hair into 4 sections. Massage directly into scalp with pads of your fingers or our silicone massager in circular motions for 3–5 minutes.
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 3 -->
      <div class="zvhc-step-card">
        <div class="zvhc-step-num">03</div>
        <div class="zvhc-step-title">Coat Lengths &amp; Ends</div>
        <div class="zvhc-step-desc">
          Smooth remaining elixir through mid-lengths down to fragile ends to lock cuticles, protect against split ends, and eliminate frizz.
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 4 -->
      <div class="zvhc-step-card">
        <div class="zvhc-step-num">04</div>
        <div class="zvhc-step-title">Rest &amp; Nourish</div>
        <div class="zvhc-step-desc">
          Leave in for at least 30 minutes, or wrap in our silk sleep bonnet overnight for intensive salon-grade follicle deep conditioning.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "ZVHC How It Works",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
